---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { copy } from '../../config/copy';
import { siteConfig } from '../../config/site';
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import profileImage from '../../assets/profile.jpeg';

const description = '關於黑糖的開發領域、技術實作，以及旅行、演唱會和這個網站。';
const structuredData = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'AboutPage',
  name: copy.about.heading,
  description,
  url: new URL('/about/', siteConfig.url).href,
  mainEntity: {
    '@type': 'Person',
    name: copy.about.name,
    alternateName: siteConfig.author,
    description: siteConfig.description,
    url: siteConfig.url,
    sameAs: [siteConfig.social.github, siteConfig.social.telegram, siteConfig.social.discord],
  },
};
---

<BaseLayout title={copy.about.title} description={description} currentPath="/about" hasPointerGlow={false} structuredData={structuredData}>
  <article class="about-page" data-pagefind-body>
    <header class="page-heading">
      <p class="page-label">黑糖ㄉ貓窩 / 關於我</p>
      <h1>{copy.about.heading}</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="reading-layout">
      <aside class="profile" aria-label="個人資料與頁面導覽">
        <div class="identity">
          <Picture
            src={profileImage}
            alt="黑糖的個人照片"
            width={112}
            height={112}
            widths={[112, 224]}
            sizes="112px"
            formats={['avif', 'webp']}
            fallbackFormat="jpeg"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div>
            <p class="profile-name">{copy.about.name}</p>
            <p class="profile-handle">HeiTang</p>
            <p class="profile-role">軟體工程師</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <nav class="page-nav" aria-label="本頁內容">
          <a href="#intro">關於我</a>
          <a href="#practice">技術與實作</a>
          <a href="#interests">其他興趣</a>
          <a href="#website">關於本站</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="contact-links">
          <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.social.email}`}>{siteConfig.social.email}</a>
          <a href={siteConfig.social.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub<span class="sr-only">（開新分頁）</span></a>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <div class="reading-content">
        <section id="intro" class="introduction" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
          <h2 id="intro-title">關於我</h2>
          <p class="lead">我是黑糖，主要做後端、資料處理與自動化，也會為自己的工具製作網頁介面。</p>
          <p>寫過的工具從資料查詢、提醒通知，到信件整理與檔案匯出都有。這個網站用來整理作品，也記錄開發過程中遇到的問題與解法。</p>
          <p class="personal-note">{copy.about.bio1}</p>
        </section>

        <section id="practice" aria-labelledby="practice-title">
          <div class="section-heading"><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><h2 id="practice-title">技術與實作</h2></div>
          <p>以下是我在個人專案中用過的技術，以及它們實際負責的事情。</p>
          <dl class="practice-list">
            <div>
              <dt>後端與 API</dt>
              <dd>
                <p>用 Python 開發查詢服務與通知工具，處理 API、資料儲存與排程。例如 <a href="/projects/remindly/">Remindly</a> 把提醒存進 SQLite，再由排程送出 Telegram 通知。</p>
                <p class="technologies">Python / FastAPI / SQLite / PostgreSQL</p>
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>資料整理</dt>
              <dd>
                <p>擷取來源資料，整理成方便查詢或再次使用的格式。<a href="/projects/fcu-coursedata/">逢甲大學課程資料集</a> 就是把歷年課程資訊整理成 CSV、JSON，並提供更新工具。</p>
                <p class="technologies">Python / Requests / CSV / JSON</p>
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Google 服務自動化</dt>
              <dd>
                <p>用 Google Apps Script 串接 Gmail 與 Google Drive，處理信件分類、附件備份和郵件匯出。<a href="/projects/gmail-archiver/">Gmail 郵件匯出與備份</a> 可以將信件轉成 PDF 或 EML，連同附件整理保存。</p>
                <p class="technologies">Google Apps Script / TypeScript / Gmail API</p>
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>網頁與部署</dt>
              <dd>
                <p>用 Astro、TypeScript 和 Tailwind CSS 製作網頁介面。這個網站透過 GitHub Actions 建置並部署到 GitHub Pages；其他服務也有使用 Docker 與 Google Cloud Run。</p>
                <p class="technologies">Astro / Tailwind CSS / GitHub Actions / Docker</p>
              </dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
          <details class="skill-details">
            <summary>完整技術清單</summary>
            <dl class="skill-list">
              {copy.about.skillGroups.map(group => (
                <div><dt>{group.label}</dt><dd>{group.skills.join('、')}</dd></div>
              ))}
            </dl>
          </details>
        </section>

        <section id="interests" aria-labelledby="interests-title">
          <div class="section-heading"><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><h2 id="interests-title">其他興趣</h2></div>
          <div class="interest">
            <h3>日本旅行</h3>
            <p>用<a href="/japan/">日本制縣圖</a>記錄去過的都道府縣，依照路過、造訪、住宿或居住等不同程度標記。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="interest">
            <h3>演唱會</h3>
            <p>把已購票的場次整理在<a href="/concerts/">演唱會足跡</a>，保留日期、場地與海報，也能回頭查看過去的紀錄。</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="website" aria-labelledby="website-title">
          <div class="section-heading"><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><h2 id="website-title">關於本站</h2></div>
          <p>黑糖ㄉ貓窩是我的個人網站，放技術筆記、開發作品與生活紀錄，也整理一些實用資源。</p>
          <p>網站以 Astro 製作，文章用 Markdown 撰寫，搜尋使用 Pagefind。想追蹤新文章，可以訂閱 <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>。</p>
          <div class="site-colophon"><span>Astro</span><span>Markdown</span><span>Pagefind</span><span>GitHub Pages</span></div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    --about-accent: rgb(var(--color-primary));
    --about-text: rgb(var(--color-text-primary));
    --about-muted: rgb(var(--color-text-secondary));
    --about-line: rgb(var(--color-text-primary) / 0.12);
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 120px 32px 80px;
    color: var(--about-text);
  }
  .page-heading { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--about-line); padding-bottom: 32px; }
  .page-label { color: var(--about-muted); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1.35; margin-top: 12px; }
  .reading-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 200px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 72px; padding-top: 40px; }
  .profile :global(img) { width: 112px; height: 112px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--about-line); }
  .profile-name { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; }
  .profile-handle { margin-top: 4px; font: 12px 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; color: var(--about-accent); }
  .profile-role { font-size: 13px; color: var(--about-muted); margin-top: 12px; }
  .page-nav { border-left: 1px solid var(--about-line); display: grid; gap: 0; margin-top: 36px; }
  .page-nav a { min-height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding-left: 16px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--about-muted); transition: color 180ms; }
  .page-nav a:hover, .page-nav a:focus-visible { color: var(--about-accent); }
  .contact-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; margin-top: 28px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--about-muted); }
  .contact-links a { min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }
  .reading-content { min-width: 0; }
  .reading-content section { scroll-margin-top: 96px; }
  .reading-content > section + section { border-top: 1px solid var(--about-line); margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 32px; }
  h2 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.5; }
  .reading-content p { color: var(--about-muted); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; margin-top: 16px; }
  .reading-content .lead { color: var(--about-text); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.9; margin-top: 20px; }
  .reading-content .personal-note { font-size: 13px; margin-top: 24px; padding-left: 16px; border-left: 2px solid var(--about-accent); }
  .section-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
  .section-heading > span { font: 11px 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; color: var(--about-accent); }
  .practice-list { margin-top: 28px; }
  .practice-list > div + div { margin-top: 28px; }
  .practice-list dt, h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
  .practice-list dd p { margin-top: 8px; }
  .reading-content .technologies { font: 11px/1.9 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; color: var(--about-accent); margin-top: 10px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .reading-content a { color: var(--about-text); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: rgb(var(--color-primary) / 0.6); text-underline-offset: 4px; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; transition: color 180ms; }
  .reading-content a:hover { color: var(--about-accent); }
  .skill-details { margin-top: 28px; border: 1px solid var(--about-line); border-radius: 8px; background: rgb(var(--color-bg-dark) / 0.45); }
  .skill-details summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 14px 18px; font-size: 13px; min-height: 48px; color: var(--about-muted); }
  .skill-details[open] summary { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--about-line); }
  .skill-list { padding: 18px; }
  .skill-list > div + div { margin-top: 16px; }
  .skill-list dt { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .skill-list dd { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--about-muted); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .interest { margin-top: 24px; }
  .interest p { margin-top: 8px; }
  .site-colophon { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 20px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--about-line); margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 18px; font: 11px/1.8 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; color: var(--about-muted); }
  @media (max-width: 959px) { .reading-layout { gap: 40px; grid-template-columns: 168px minmax(0, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .about-page { padding: 100px 24px 48px; }
    .page-heading { padding-bottom: 24px; }
    .reading-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 32px; padding-top: 28px; }
    .identity { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; }
    .profile-name { margin-top: 0; }
    .profile-role { margin-top: 8px; }
    .page-nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--about-line); padding-bottom: 12px; margin-top: 20px; gap: 0 20px; }
    .page-nav a { padding-left: 0; }
    .contact-links { flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0 20px; margin-top: 8px; }
    .reading-content .lead { font-size: 18px; }
    .reading-content > section + section { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 28px; }
  }
</style>
